<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia posts $970.7 million May trade surplus.</title>
<headline>Indonesia posts $970.7 million May trade surplus.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia posted a trade surplus of $970.7 million in May, compared with $674.3 million in April, the Ministry for Trade and Industry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Following are the trade figures for May, in millions of dollars, with comparisons for the previous month and a year earlier:</p>
<p>				  May	  April	May 96</p>
<p>    Trade balance	  +970.7     +674.3	+203.1</p>
<p>    Exports		 4,588.2    4,230.6     4,075.2</p>
<p>    Imports		 3,617.5    3,556.3     3,872.1</p>
<p>    Oil/gas exports	 980.1	973.5	 870.5</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
